  %% Exemplary Core Flow: Instant P2P Transfer (FLOW-02)
  cmd_payment_execution_initiate -->|1. Resolve| qry_party_routing_resolve
  cmd_payment_execution_initiate -->|2. Fraud Score| cmd_fraud_detection_evaluate_tx
  cmd_payment_execution_initiate -->|3. Start Saga| sfn_payment_instant_transfer_saga
  sfn_payment_instant_transfer_saga -->|4. Hold Funds| cmd_position_keeping_reserve
  sfn_payment_instant_transfer_saga -->|5. Instant Rail| plug_directory_federation_bridge
  sfn_payment_instant_transfer_saga -->|6. Commit| cmd_position_keeping_release
  sfn_payment_instant_transfer_saga -->|7. Outbox Event| EventBus
  EventBus -.->|Event Subscription| prj_payment_execution_history
  EventBus -.->|Event Subscription| cmd_customer_alert_dispatch
  cmd_customer_alert_dispatch -->|Push| plug_fcm_apns_push_gateway
